{"problem":{"stackLimit":128,"modifiedUser":"FrankieFly","judgeCaseMode":"default","auth":1,"description":"今天，然弟要参加数学考试。老师给出了由 $a$ 个 $1$ 和 $b$ 个 $2$ 组成的数组。\n\n在数组中，然弟必须在每个元素前面加上 \"+\"或\"\\-\"，这样数组中所有元素的和就等于 $0$ 。\n\n然弟不确定是否有可能解决这个问题，所以要确定是否有办法分配符号，使数组中所有元素的和等于 $0$ 。","source":"改编","title":"数学考试","type":0,"output":"对于每个测试用例，如果能使整个数组的和等于 $0$ ，则输出 \"YES\"，否则输出 \"NO\"。","ioScore":100,"codeShare":true,"isFileIO":false,"isRemote":false,"timeLimit":1000,"difficulty":0,"input":"第一行包含一个整数 $t$ ( $1\\le t\\le 2000$ ) - 测试用例数。\n\n每个测试用例的唯一一行包含两个整数 $a$ 和 $b$ ( $0$≤$a$,$b$<$10000$ ) - 数组中 \"1 \"和 \"2 \"的个数。","examples":"<input>5\n0 1\n0 3\n2 0\n2 3\n3 1</input><output>NO\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO</output>","hint":"1.  $a=0$ , $b=1$ :这意味着数组是 $[2]$ - 不可能通过添加符号 \"+\"或\"\\-\"得到 $0$ 的结果；\n2.  $a=0$ , $b=3$ :这意味着数组为 $[2, 2, 2]$ - 不可能通过添加符号 \"+\"或\"\\-\"得到结果 $0$ ；\n3.  $a=2$ , $b=0$ :这意味着数组是 $[1, 1]$ - 可以通过添加符号'+'或'\\-'来得到 $0$ 的结果（ $+1-1=0$ ）；\n4.  $a=2$ , $b=3$ :这意味着数组是 $[1, 1, 2, 2, 2]$ - 可以通过添加符号 \"+\"或\"\\-\"得到结果 $0$ （ $+1+1-2-2+2=0$ ）；","isRemoveEndBlank":true,"openCaseResult":true,"memoryLimit":256,"problemId":"Q0015","isGroup":false,"isUploadCase":true,"judgeMode":"default"},"languages":["C","C++","Python3","Java"],"samples":[{"output":"Q00151.out","input":"Q00151.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00152.out","input":"Q00152.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00153.out","input":"Q00153.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00154.out","input":"Q00154.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00155.out","input":"Q00155.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00156.out","input":"Q00156.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00157.out","input":"Q00157.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00158.out","input":"Q00158.in","score":10},{"output":"Q00159.out","input":"Q00159.in","score":10},{"output":"Q001510.out","input":"Q001510.in","score":10}],"tags":["数学","贪心"],"codeTemplates":[],"judgeMode":"default"}